  members: ModuleDoc ModuleDocComment 0..94 "//! Threads summing halves of an array each, borrowed by both, joined for their sums (spec 08,"
  members: ModuleDoc ModuleDocComment 95..192 "//! section 2). A system running one thread sums both halves on it. A third thread reads past the"
  members: ModuleDoc ModuleDocComment 193..288 "//! array: the trap ends that thread alone, and joining it gives the trap (spec 07, section 3)."
